<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets 300 million mark Dec 2001 bond. [CORRECTED 09:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets 300 million mark Dec 2001 bond. [CORRECTED 09:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LW RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.53    PAY DATE  S 07.MAY.97</p>
<p>(Corrects Pay Date from 08.MAY.97 to 07.MAY.97)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.78     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFURT/AMS PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
